# NOT ignored, deliberately: secrets/ipfs-cluster.env. That file is COMMITTED,
# because sops encrypts values in place, so what lands in git is ciphertext and
# the repo stays the single source of truth for what the box decrypts. An
# ignored secrets/ directory is how a fleet ends up with a secret that exists on
# one laptop.
